# QA Code / Test Review

## Must check

1. Claimed scenarios vs actual asserts
2. EditMode vs PlayMode appropriateness
3. Isolation (Reset/TearDown, no shared dirty state)
4. Determinism (waits, fixed configs, no time races)
5. Category/CI alignment (`DemoAI` misuse?)
6. Factory extension quality vs copy-paste setups
7. Whether failures would diagnose product bugs clearly

## Output

```
Verdict: APPROVE | REQUEST CHANGES | BLOCK
Findings:
- [P0/P1/P2] path — issue — fix
Coverage map:
- TC / behavior → test name
Flake risks:
- ...
CI:
- ...
```
